[05/14 10:39:06     32s] @file 140: ### Sroute  
[05/14 10:39:06     32s] @file 141: # Explanation : Our VDD and GND pads needs to connect to the power rings - otherwise our power rings would just be floating!
[05/14 10:39:06     32s] @file 142: #               The connection in these pads are on layer M6 respectively M7. 
[05/14 10:39:06     32s] @file 143: #               We use the special route to tell the tool to connect the `pad_pins` (i.e., the pin connection of the pads) for the net VDD resp. GND
